    "name": "Hide Useless Google Docs/Slides/Sheets Icons",
    "description": "Hide buttons you generally don't need, like undo/redo/zoom. The space that's freed up this way allows the ui to show more buttons, specially in narrow screens.\r\n\r\nList of hidden buttons:\r\n\r\n#newSlideButton, #newSlideMenuButton,#redoButton,#undoButton,#printButton,#paintFormatButton,#zoomButton,#selectButton, #insertLinkButton,#insertCommentButton, #commentSeparator, #indentButton, #outdentButton",
